% multipletictactoe
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of an Epilog game, written by the Epilog translator
% from multipletictactoe.hrf (kept in sources/): the operations are causal laws, the
% views over the state intensional fluents.
% The scenario is a play EpilogJS made; LPS2's final state of it is checked against EpilogJS's
% (test_epilog.pl).
% Source: the Epilog Games page, http://epilog.stanford.edu/homepage/game.php?game=multipletictactoe
%
% DISCLAIMER. This program was written by a translator from a program of another
% system. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
% implied, including any warranty that it is accurate, complete or fit for a
% particular purpose. The translation may be wrong: check it against its source
% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move mark with *an index*, *a second index*, *a third index* and *a fourth index* is made; known as mark.

the fluents are:
    *an index* cell *a second index* with *a third index* with *a fourth index* with *a thing*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *an index* is the played of *a second index*; known as played.
    *a thing* col *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*; known as col.
    *a thing* diag *a second thing* with *a third thing*; known as diag.
    the move mark with *an index*, *a second index*, *a third index* and *a fourth index* is legal; known as legal_mark.
    open; known as open.
    *a thing* row *a second thing* with *a third thing* with *a fourth thing*; known as row.
    *a thing* is a line; known as line.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.

the templates are:
    *an index* is an index.

the knowledge base multipletictactoe includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/multipletictactoe.hrf".

1 is an index.

2 is an index.

3 is an index.

the move mark with an index, a second index, a third index and a fourth index is legal at a time if
    the index cell the second index with the third index with the fourth index with b at the time
    and it is not the case that the index is the played of the second index at the time.

the goal of x is 100 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

the goal of x is 50 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of x is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

the goal of x is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 100 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 50 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 0 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    x is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    o is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    it is not the case that open at the time.

a thing row a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing at a time if
    the thing cell the second thing with the third thing with 1 with the fourth thing at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with the third thing with 2 with the fourth thing at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with the third thing with 3 with the fourth thing at the time.

a thing col a second thing with a third thing with a fourth thing at a time if
    the thing cell the second thing with 1 with the third thing with the fourth thing at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with 2 with the third thing with the fourth thing at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with 3 with the third thing with the fourth thing at the time.

a thing diag a second thing with a third thing at a time if
    the thing cell the second thing with 1 with 1 with the third thing at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with 2 with 2 with the third thing at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with 3 with 3 with the third thing at the time.

a thing diag a second thing with a third thing at a time if
    the thing cell the second thing with 1 with 3 with the third thing at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with 2 with 2 with the third thing at the time
    and the thing cell the second thing with 3 with 1 with the third thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    2 row 2 with a second thing with the thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    2 col 2 with a second thing with the thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    2 diag 2 with the thing at the time.

open at a time if
    2 cell 2 with an index with a second index with b at the time.

when the move mark with an index, a second index, a third index and a fourth index is made
    and a role is a control
then the index cell the second index with the third index with the fourth index with the role
    and it is not the case that the index cell the second index with the third index with the fourth index with b.

when the move mark with an index, a second index, a third index and a fourth index is made
    and the index is different from 2
then the index is the played of the second index.

when the move mark with an index, a second index, a third index and a fourth index is made
    and the second index is different from 2
then the index is the played of the second index.

when the move mark with 2, 2, an index and a second index is made
    and a third index is an index
    and a fourth index is an index
then it is not the case that the third index is the played of the fourth index.

when the move mark with 2, 2, an index and a second index is made
    and x is a control
then o is a control
    and it is not the case that x is a control.

when the move mark with 2, 2, an index and a second index is made
    and o is a control
then x is a control
    and it is not the case that o is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move mark with an index, a second index, a third index and a fourth index is made
    and it is not the case that the move mark with the index, the second index, the third index and the fourth index is legal.

